ging."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l009","ordinal":188800,"en":"On the plain he shot,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l010","ordinal":188801,"en":"Teach all four"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l011","ordinal":188802,"en":"Sometimes just"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l012","ordinal":188803,"en":"Blueberry* drag."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l013","ordinal":188804,"en":"Karagul comes shouting,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l014","ordinal":188805,"en":"The necklace is made of coral* stone"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l015","ordinal":188806,"en":"Summoning Khan Lung-tung*,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l016","ordinal":188807,"en":"Screaming that I'm dead"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l017","ordinal":188808,"en":"If I want to kill a slave,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l018","ordinal":188809,"en":"Semetei wants to take care."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l019","ordinal":188810,"en":"Underneath the wheat"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l020","ordinal":188811,"en":"Buurul begged the horse:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l021","ordinal":188812,"en":"\"Now let's turn around, my brother"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l022","ordinal":188813,"en":"Buurul is an animal, too"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l023","ordinal":188814,"en":"Black cousin!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l024","ordinal":188815,"en":"Rabies touched my hand,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l025","ordinal":188816,"en":"Put your head down"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l026","ordinal":188817,"en":"Come on, my brother,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l027","ordinal":188818,"en":"Try to get your strength in a different way!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l028","ordinal":188819,"en":"The abuse of this dog,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l029","ordinal":188820,"en":"Is it from my bones?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l030","ordinal":188821,"en":"The force of the water."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0035:b003:l031","ordinal":1